// Yekermo Sew Film Lab 0.1.0-alpha.1 - M1 color and diagnostics foundation.
// Original parametric creative models, NOT measured film-stock emulations.
// Input must already be decoded RGB with the selected scene encoding.
// See docs/RESOLVE_SETUP.md and docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md before installation.
// UI order is part of the saved-grade contract. Append; do not reorder.

